Running the Project:
  
  Open index.html in a browser or run via a local server(Live server recommended).

Project Status:

  All major components (accordion, tabs, slider, rotator, scroll logic) are implemented. The project is now in the final polish phase, focusing on layout refinement, spacing consistency, responsiveness, and visual cohesion.  